sed on the reward</td> <td>The agent adjusts its strategy - reinforcing act=
ions that led to high rewards and avoiding those that led low rewards</td><=
/tr> <tr><td>5. Iteration</td> <td>Repeat the process</td> <td>This cycle c=
ontinues, allowing the agent to continuously improve its decision-making</t=
d></tr></tbody></table> <p data-svelte-h=3D"svelte-wet5s9">Think about lear=
ning to ride a bike. You might wobble and fall at first (negative reward!).=
 But when you manage to balance and pedal smoothly, you feel good (positive=
